        "title": "Why Memorize",
        "description": "<p>We believe the moments that matter aren’t just photographed—they’re kept. Beyond the smiling photos, we honor the tangible keepsakes that tell your story—love letters, teeny tiny socks, paint-splattered art, first baseball gloves, communion crosses, and wedding shoes. Each Memorize Trunk is <strong>quilted to protect what matters</strong>—soft where it should be, structured where it counts—with a wide range of fabric aesthetics and custom embroidery that creates a <strong>signature home</strong> for what you’ll come back to again and again. Because <strong>legacy doesn’t have one look.</strong>&nbsp;</p>",
