    "memorize_our_story_fPdWKe": {
      "type": "memorize-our-story",
      "name": "Memorize Our Story",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Our Story",
        "heading": "Modern Keepsake Trunks.\nRefined Tailoring.\nPersonal Stories.",
        "subtitle": "<p>Memorize Trunks exists because I couldn't find the right one.</p>",
        "body": "<p>As I gathered keepsakes from my daughter's childhood, hand-knit sweaters from my Aunt Shelley, handwritten cards from her grandparents, finger-paint canvases, and her first tiny grass-stained soccer jersey, I knew those memories deserved more than a plastic bin with a P-touch label. I envisioned a keepsake trunk with impeccably tailored construction, quilted interiors, and fabrics that felt design-forward. So I decided to create one.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Memorize-Custom-Styled-Trunks-Our-Story-Slonim-family.webp",
        "image_alt": "Memorize Trunks founder with family",
        "background_color": "#fffbf8",
        "heading_color": "#07354a",
        "text_color": "#07354a",
        "accent_color": "#920968",
        "content_width": 1300,
        "padding_top": 72,
        "padding_bottom": 72,
        "margin_top": 0,
        "margin_bottom": 0,
        "mobile_padding_top": 12,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 40,
        "mobile_margin_top": 0,
        "mobile_margin_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "gayle_founder_story_4zJBfq": {
      "type": "gayle-founder-story",
      "name": "Gayle Founder Story",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/4_af11e6d0-ab46-4c19-b458-f3c97fb2acbb.png",
        "image_alt": "Gayle selecting fabrics for Memorize Trunks",
        "story": "<p>After more than 20 years in product development, including L’Oréal and Bath & Body Works, I knew that trust is built through the smallest details. Every material, every design decision, every choice matters. I found my first fabrics at Mood in New York City. Then I met with cut-and-sew factories and upholsterers until I found one that could tailor the interiors the way I envisioned.</p><p>The result was a new approach to memory keeping: steel exteriors paired with signature machine-quilted fabric interiors that bring both softness and structure. And because legacy doesn’t have one look, neither do our fabrics. From modern classic to grand millennial, French country to coastal and Americana, our collection is designed to reflect your style, your story, and the memories that matter to you.</p><p>Every Memorize Trunk is made to order, tailored in New York, and personally overseen by me.</p>",
        "signature": "XO, Gayle",
        "signature_caption": "Founder & Lifelong Memory Keeper",
        "background_color": "#fffbf8",
        "text_color": "#07354a",
        "caption_color": "#597486",
        "content_width": 1300,
        "column_gap": 60,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 72,
        "margin_top": 0,
        "margin_bottom": 0,
        "mobile_padding_top": 0,
